WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.601
With influencers, the brand carries the legal risk, not the creator.

00:00:04.651 --> 00:00:08.209
A free product counts as paid advertising, so disclose it.

00:00:08.259 --> 00:00:13.162
Know the risk types, follow the industry code, and check brand safety properly.

00:00:13.867 --> 00:00:15.326
One washing powder brand signed a creator without checking her other content,

00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:18.039
and left the comments open.

00:00:18.089 --> 00:00:22.329
The brand, not the creator, wore it.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.905
Never trust a screen grab.

00:00:24.955 --> 00:00:29.719
Check deleted posts, fit, swearing and politics before you sign.

00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:31.562
Use it like this:

00:00:31.612 --> 00:00:32.412
disclose,

00:00:32.438 --> 00:00:33.238
vet,

00:00:33.051 --> 00:00:33.851
contract and measure,

00:00:33.511 --> 00:00:37.039
and name the risk each one cuts.
